-- ==========================================
-- MOVEMENT SCRIPT v15
-- ==========================================
-- NEW in v15:
--
-- 1. AIR-DASH (double jump / Stumble Guys style)
--    While in the air after a normal jump, if a laser is about to hit
--    the arc mid-flight, the script fires a second ChangeState(Jumping)
--    with a new MoveTo target to dash sideways/forward over the beam.
--    Uses a separate airdash cooldown so it only fires once per jump.
--
-- 2. FAST-LASER EARLY TRIGGER
--    TTI (time-to-impact) is recalculated every frame. If TTI < FAST_TTI
--    the jump trigger activates even if localZ > JUMP_TRIGGER_DISTANCE.
--    This catches lasers that are far but moving so fast the player
--    would be hit before reaching trigger range.
--
-- 3. LOOKAHEAD PATHFINDER
--    Every PLAN_INTERVAL seconds a planner simulates the next
--    PLAN_STEPS jumps into the future:
--      - For each threat laser, project its position forward by
--        (accumulated time of previous jumps + travel time).
--      - Pick the safest landing zone at each step.
--      - Store the plan as a sequence of waypoints.
--    The plan is visualised as:
--      - Yellow spheres = planned landing positions
--      - Cyan lines (thin cylinders) connecting them
--      - Each sphere labelled step 1,2,3 via BillboardGui
--    The bot follows the plan's first waypoint as its jump target
--    instead of computing it reactively each frame.
--    If the plan becomes stale (laser moved) it is re-planned.
--
-- All v14 systems kept: crossing detection, multi-laser arc,
-- position-delta move dir, stand-still-and-wait.
-- ==========================================
print("[Movement] v15 loaded")

